                        ],
                        "form": "регре́ссе"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e95470d8-4583-4aae-ba3c-d44928872cb8",
                        "entry_id": "11812312-b1f2-30d1-a3c8-71273b4326cc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "регре́ссах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "489f5e83-1e9f-3cef-81e2-e7efed4c9ec5",
                        "entry_id": "11812312-b1f2-30d1-a3c8-71273b4326cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "переход от более высоких форм развития к более низким; упадок в развитии чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e34220e-b8b4-4231-81b2-132a8a27f9bf",
                                "sense_id": "489f5e83-1e9f-3cef-81e2-e7efed4c9ec5",
                                "text": "Ясно, что европейский ученый, считающий свою цивилизацию верхом достигнутого на земле совершенства, может назвать такое движение только «регрессом», «упадком», «одичанием»."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5da9fe3b-47ba-3582-89c2-bf7388f8f5eb",
                        "entry_id": "11812312-b1f2-30d1-a3c8-71273b4326cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "физиол. утрата функций органами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d0d3a6c-481a-4ba5-aee0-39caaee8e232",
                                "sense_id": "5da9fe3b-47ba-3582-89c2-bf7388f8f5eb",
                                "text": "Пытаясь объяснить этот «регресс» зрения, учёные давно предположили, что цветовое зрение помогало обезьянам отличать спелые плоды от незрелых."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7cffa198-c4a5-379e-8227-5b70b54b2c6e",
                        "entry_id": "11812312-b1f2-30d1-a3c8-71273b4326cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "юр. право субъекта на компенсацию понесённых потерь от другого субъекта при каких-либо обстоятельствах при наличии обязательств этого другого субъекта при наступлении такого обстоятельства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7232e0e2-3a16-4a8b-bd84-47ddcbbf4775",
                                "sense_id": "7cffa198-c4a5-379e-8227-5b70b54b2c6e",
                                "text": "Покупатель в этих операциях принимает на себя весь риск, связанный с платежами за поставку, поскольку в передаточной надписи делается оговорка «без регресса»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "542bef21-dbf2-4d65-b1e3-8f2e87b63e6b",
                                "sense_id": "7cffa198-c4a5-379e-8227-5b70b54b2c6e",
                                "text": "1. Сумма компенсационной выплаты, произведенной потерпевшему в соответствии с подпунктами «б» и «в» пункта 1 статьи 18 настоящего Федерального закона, взыскивается в порядке регресса по иску профессионального объединения страховщиков с лица, ответственного за причиненный потерпевшему вред."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13551325-1713-31f3-9b57-3eb08492c521",
                        "entry_id": "11812312-b1f2-30d1-a3c8-71273b4326cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "процесс, при котором с течением времени снижается какой-либо количественный показатель, размер, величина чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "88bddf22-69d2-4a2d-bd63-b2fd420051c5",
                                "sense_id": "13551325-1713-31f3-9b57-3eb08492c521",
                                "text": "Регресс был не только количественным, но и качественным: камень, как строительный материал, сменила древесина; с прекращением ввоза соды из Средиземноморья исчезло рейнское стекольное искусство."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "585d39b0-b15d-4460-b7ba-6322bcba86c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "11812312-b1f2-30d1-a3c8-71273b4326cc",
                        "target_lang_word": "regress",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "regress",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7620d18-18f4-3623-9a7a-6222193d4937",
                                        "entry_id": "d4426bfd-29d7-3db9-b90b-912059e72d86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of passing back; passage back; return; retrogression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5d740bf-3c90-4c3d-9cfc-51652ed8a65c",
                                                "sense_id": "c7620d18-18f4-3623-9a7a-6222193d4937",
                                                "text": "Its bearing on the progress or regress of man is not an inconsiderable question."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0024a1a2-6c95-3d9d-802a-ef48212e4253",
                                        "entry_id": "d4426bfd-29d7-3db9-b90b-912059e72d86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The power or liberty of passing back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdee56a5-517a-4c69-bf82-a42d7d75aeb6",
                                                "sense_id": "0024a1a2-6c95-3d9d-802a-ef48212e4253",
                                                "text": "Thou shalt have egresse and regresse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd13d617-f371-3166-967f-4e21d8cfc76b",
                                        "entry_id": "d4426bfd-29d7-3db9-b90b-912059e72d86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The right of a person (such as a lessee) to return to a property."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "regress",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "418d2709-ba05-312a-b208-7213b23354b0",
                                        "entry_id": "0a54be34-d447-3335-9c27-b4d5ded84d71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move backwards to an earlier stage; to devolve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81dde224-0c5e-3d9a-a6ed-a9c47ba99b16",
                                        "entry_id": "0a54be34-d447-3335-9c27-b4d5ded84d71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move backwards to an earlier stage; to devolve.",
                                            "To re-develop behavior one had previously grown out of, particularly a behavior left behind in childhood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "509fae05-1a3f-4571-895b-b3d55fb7823b",
                                                "sense_id": "81dde224-0c5e-3d9a-a6ed-a9c47ba99b16",
                                                "text": "Your nightmares stopped when you were eight years old, but after the house burned down, you regressed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c93d5f0-118a-31e4-aa62-83b22b6147e6",
                                        "entry_id": "0a54be34-d447-3335-9c27-b4d5ded84d71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move in the retrograde direction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "682b8c66-b314-3740-b4a4-9c4bc1321afa",
                                        "entry_id": "0a54be34-d447-3335-9c27-b4d5ded84d71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reduce in severity or size (as of a tumor), without reaching total remission."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a60ba9e-9f76-39fa-a3d7-aa173a34a6b4",
                                        "entry_id": "0a54be34-d447-3335-9c27-b4d5ded84d71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform a regression on an explanatory variable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd6a2019-54fc-4d02-8c9f-918573c3a76c",
                                                "sense_id": "1a60ba9e-9f76-39fa-a3d7-aa173a34a6b4",
                                                "text": "When we regress Y on X, we use the values of variable X to predict those of Y."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe3de8c6-5bd5-3eda-9c1b-40e14211133f",
                                        "entry_id": "0a54be34-d447-3335-9c27-b4d5ded84d71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To interrogate a person in a state of trance about forgotten elements of their past."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29670939-897e-4995-a652-328d5abfa728",
                                                "sense_id": "fe3de8c6-5bd5-3eda-9c1b-40e14211133f",
                                                "text": "They regressed me, putting me under hypnosis. Then, through the hypnosis, they found out that our car was abducted right off the road and into a craft."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4563b73e-11f1-4f03-af43-f4b68dca497c",
                        "source_entry_id": "11812312-b1f2-30d1-a3c8-71273b4326cc",
                        "target_lang_word": "devolution",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "devolution",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "450daaae-39f7-3154-9ef6-8fc96d99b67b",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rolling down."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c86a5243-d6c2-38a0-b9d6-dc889d77b2dc",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A descent, especially one that passes through a series of revolutions, or by succession."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fab36a9b-6ace-35c8-bf82-522c57eefdf0",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The transference of a right to a successor, or of a power from one body to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef3054a7-c563-3b27-a14f-83876e47843b",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Degeneration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d819d6b-b0ca-48de-9c53-cccb607fbb30",
                                                "sense_id": "ef3054a7-c563-3b27-a14f-83876e47843b",
                                                "text": "It is quite disheartening to witness the devolution of our nation's political discourse over the past several years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d019ec55-fe8b-47d5-8c3b-4336ac577c4b",
                                                "sense_id": "ef3054a7-c563-3b27-a14f-83876e47843b",
                                                "text": "He is the place where the devolution from Heaven and the evolution from earth meet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The transfer of some powers and the delegation of some functions from a central government to local government (e.g. from the U.K. parliament to Scottish parliament and Welsh assembly)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1219e3ec-7c20-428b-a836-1ab07675354a",
                                                "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                                "text": "The question of whether England should receive devolution like Scotland and Wales have has dogged British politics for years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1a1a15e-afbd-4ac2-bfad-2e3fb414c292",
                                                "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                                "text": "Governments like devolution because it gives ministers someone else to blame for problems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74cd0ba3-1e52-4d9f-bd48-8317cdfd3849",
                                                "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                                "text": "By the 1974 general election, the Scottish National Party (SNP) were polling at 30% and there were growing calls for devolution."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
